    "title": "Bread Financial",
    "description": "Enjoy a simple way to manage your Bread Cashback\u2122 American Express\u00ae Credit Card, Bread RewardsTM American Express\u00ae Credit Card, and AAA Visa Signature\u00ae credit card accounts on the go. \r\nAnd, we\u2019re working hard to add more brands to the app soon!\r\n\r\nAccess your account anytime, anywhere, logging in with the same username and password you use on Account Center. Inside the app, you can make a payment, redeem your rewards, and review transaction history and more\u2014all at your fingertips.\r\n\r\nManage Your Account Easily\r\n- Log in quickly and securely with username/password or biometrics \r\n- Review transactions and statements\r\n- Search recent activity and filter as needed\r\n- Activate your card, add an authorized buyer and lock and unlock your card (for select programs)\r\n\r\nMake Payments in a Few Taps\r\n- Set up automatic payments\r\n- Schedule a one-time payment\r\n- Edit or delete a scheduled payment\r\n\r\nGet Rewarded as You Shop (for select programs)\r\n- Track your reward earnings\r\n- Redeem in any amount you\u2019d like\r\n- Unlock exclusive offers on our partner site, linked on the app\r\n\r\nEnjoy Safe and Secure Communication\r\n- Reach out to us any time through our Secure Message Center\r\n\r\nCopyright \u00a9 2024 Bread Financial. Comenity Bank and Comenity Capital Bank are Bread Financial companies.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Enjoy a simple way to manage your Bread Cashback\u2122 American Express\u00ae Credit Card, Bread RewardsTM American Express\u00ae Credit Card, and AAA Visa Signature\u00ae credit card accounts on the go. <br>And, we\u2019re working hard to add more brands to the app soon!<br><br>Access your account anytime, anywhere, logging in with the same username and password you use on Account Center. Inside the app, you can make a payment, redeem your rewards, and review transaction history and more\u2014all at your fingertips.<br><br>Manage Your Account Easily<br>- Log in quickly and securely with username/password or biometrics <br>- Review transactions and statements<br>- Search recent activity and filter as needed<br>- Activate your card, add an authorized buyer and lock and unlock your card (for select programs)<br><br>Make Payments in a Few Taps<br>- Set up automatic payments<br>- Schedule a one-time payment<br>- Edit or delete a scheduled payment<br><br>Get Rewarded as You Shop (for select programs)<br>- Track your reward earnings<br>- Redeem in any amount you\u2019d like<br>- Unlock exclusive offers on our partner site, linked on the app<br><br>Enjoy Safe and Secure Communication<br>- Reach out to us any time through our Secure Message Center<br><br>Copyright \u00a9 2024 Bread Financial. Comenity Bank and Comenity Capital Bank are Bread Financial companies.",
